OL,3,GNEWSAImpact of drought 'can be seen
OL,4,Aalong River Severn'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe impact of this year's drought can
OL,7,Fbe seen along parts of the River
OL,8,FSevern, people who use the river have
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FGeoff Maguire from Kidderminster and
OL,12,FDistrict Angling Association said water
OL,13,Flevels were probably the lowest he had
OL,14,Fseen.
OL,16,FNatural Resources Wales has applied to
OL,17,Fthe Welsh Government for a Drought
OL,18,FOrder on the river while the
OL,19,FEnvironment Agency (EA) has submitted a
OL,20,Fmatching application for the English
OL,21,Fstretch.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
